sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SAC as SB3 SAC (GPU)
    participant VN as VecNormalize / DummyVecEnv / Monitor
    participant ENV as SO101ReachEnv (Gymnasium)
    participant TS as ReachableTargetSampler
    participant RB as MujocoSo101Backend (RobotBackend)
    participant MJ as MuJoCo
    participant RF as ReachReward (RewardFunction)

    Note over SAC,RF: Episode start
    SAC->>VN: reset()
    VN->>ENV: reset(seed)
    ENV->>TS: sample(np_random)
    TS->>MJ: random joints, mj_kinematics, mj_collision
    TS-->>ENV: target xyz (above table, in band, collision-free)
    ENV->>RB: reset(np_random)
    RB->>MJ: restore or randomize gains, mj_resetData, home pose, mj_forward
    RB-->>ENV: RobotState
    ENV->>RB: set_target_marker(target)
    ENV-->>VN: obs = ObservationLayout.pack(...)
    VN-->>SAC: normalized obs

    Note over SAC,RF: Every step until step 150
    SAC->>SAC: actor samples action in [-1, 1]
    SAC->>VN: step(action)
    VN->>ENV: step(action)
    ENV->>RB: apply_delta(action x 0.07 rad)
    Note right of RB: q_cmd += delta, clipped to joint limits
    ENV->>RB: step()
    RB->>MJ: ctrl = q_cmd, mj_step x 33 (1 ms each), mj_forward
    RB-->>ENV: RobotState (qpos, qvel, q_cmd, tcp_pos)
    ENV->>RF: reward_fn(state, target, action, prev_action)
    RF-->>ENV: RewardTerms (distance, bonus, penalties, total)
    ENV-->>VN: obs, reward, terminated=False, truncated, info
    VN-->>SAC: normalized obs, raw reward, auto-reset if truncated
    SAC->>SAC: store transition in replay buffer
    SAC->>SAC: sample batch of 256, update critics, actor, entropy

    Note over SAC,RF: After all timesteps
    SAC->>SAC: save model.zip and vecnormalize.pkl
